  // Verb actions — the crafting actions of the identity system (docs/transformation-verbs.md
  // §1/§8, D47/D48): verb + parameters + gates + costs + fiction name. Migration Phase 5:
  // the full D48 matrix — every profession's kit at its own station, gates in the §8.3
  // waves (Process/Refine early · Reveal/Transfer mid · Develop/Extract/Restore mid-late ·
  // Fuse/Displace late · Expand last), and every action pays experience (bench work trains).
  // Every gate is the action's own; stations only route (D48). XP values are provisional,
  // sized against the profession-action ladder (L1 ≈ 10-25, L30 ≈ 54, L70 ≈ 118).

